## Domain Model Quick Reference

### ID Naming Patterns
```
Curriculum: 'gc2' | 'bbs1'
Lesson:     '{curriculumId}-l{number}'        → 'gc2-l1'
Slice:      '{lessonId}-s{number}'            → 'gc2-l1-s1'
Step:       '{sliceId}-st{number}'            → 'gc2-l1-s1-st1'
Drill:      '{lessonId}-drill-{number}'       → 'gc2-l01-drill-1'
Session:    UUID (crypto.randomUUID())
Student:    StudentId (string)
```

### Confidence Scale
```typescript
type Confidence = 1 | 2 | 3;
```

### Observation Types
```typescript
type Observation =
  | { type: 'step-assessed'; stepId: Id; confidence: Confidence; notes?: string; nextAction?: 'Teach' | 'Review' | 'Reteach' }
  | { type: 'slice-assessed'; sliceId: Id; confidence: Confidence; notes?: string; nextAction?: 'Teach' | 'Review' | 'Reteach' }
  | { type: 'timer'; label: string; start: number; stop: number };
```

