## File Structure Guidelines

### Where to Create New Files

**New Page Route**
```
app/(main)/new-feature/page.tsx
```

**New Feature Component**
```
features/new-feature/NewFeatureComponent.tsx
```

**New Domain Type**
```
core/domain/new-feature.types.ts
```

**New Service**
```
core/services/newFeatureService.ts
```

**New Static Data**
```
data/new-curriculum.curriculum.v1.ts
```

### Naming Conventions
- **Files**: kebab-case with extensions
- **Components**: PascalCase
- **Functions**: camelCase
- **Types/Interfaces**: PascalCase

